To securely manage secrets like tokens, keys, and passwords using HashiCorp Vault :
first method :
    - vault ui : enter token (its in .env)
second method :
    - install vault client
    - https://developer.hashicorp.com/vault/install
    - vault -h # show its install or not
    - vault login # ask for token (from .env) -> (if any error double check for env varibale vault and check for docker container is running)
    - example how can i store : vault kv put  secret/test pass=test1234
    - to get secret from engine : vault kv get secret/test 
